 tres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sanf
 ord. Experience the soaring melodies and heart-wrenching journey of the Ma
 rch sisters as they navigate the trials of the American Civil War and the 
 triumphs of finding their own voices. Enjoy a musical filled night of laug
 hter\, tears\, personal discovery\, heartache and everlasting love that ma
 kes the pages of the classic book literally jump to life on stage.\n\nTick
 ets range from $25 to $40 with discounts available for active military\, L
 ee County educators and students\, and groups of 10 or more. Visit temples
 hows.org or call 919-774-4512 for more information.
