DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special screening of “You Can’t Go Home Again
 ” from CBS\, a rare chance to experience Thomas Wolfe’s work on screen
 .\n\nThis adaptation of the classic novel stars Chris Sarandon and Lee Gra
 nt and follows the story of a young writer trying to make it in New York\,
  his relationships\, and the editor who sees his potential for literary ge
 nius. Come join us\, grab some popcorn\, and enjoy the nostalgia of this 1
 979 television movie.\n\nThis is a FREE EVENT. Please reserve your seat he
 re: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/film-screening-you-cant-go-home-
 again-from-cbs–1979\n\nWe happily accept donations\, which support the M
 emorial’s programming and other special events like this.
GEO:35.597566;-82.551258
LOCATION:Thomas Wolfe Memorial
