X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/rennie-harris-puremovement-american-dance-theater"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261017T041252Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54188215535778
DTSTART:20261017T000000Z
DTEND:20261017T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Rennie Harris Puremovement American Dance Theater (RHPM) is the
  leading US street dance theater company\, and for over thirty-five years 
 has been dedicated to preserving and disseminating hip-hop aesthetics and 
 street dance culture through workshops\, classes\, history\, lecture demon
 strations\, long-term residencies\, mentoring programs\, and public perfor
 mances. With his roots in the inner-city\, Harris and RHPM present unique 
 stories that are riveting\, intimate\, and honest. RHPM’s mission is to 
 re-educate the public about hip-hop culture and street dance through its a
 rtistic work\, sharing the essence and spirit of street dance\, rather tha
 n the commercially exploited stereotype portrayed by the media. \n\nDr. Lo
 renzo “Rennie” Harris is a leading ambassador for hip-hop. Harris grew
  up entrenched in hip-hop culture in all its forms—music\, dance\, langu
 age. Throughout his career\, he has embraced the culture and sought to hon
 or its legacy\, believing that hip-hop and street dance is the purest form
  of movement in that it honors both African and African American-Latino cu
 lture. Harris is well versed in the vernacular of what he calls hip-hop 
 “proper\,” as well as the various techniques of B-boy\, house\, GQ and
  other styles that have emerged spontaneously from the inner cities of Ame
 rica\, like the North Philadelphia community in which he was raised. \n\nP
 art of the UNCG University Concert and Lecture Series.
GEO:36.066912;-79.80608
LOCATION:UNCG Auditorium
SUMMARY:Rennie Harris Puremovement American Dance Theater 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/rennie-harris-puremovement-a
 merican-dance-theater
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Dance
END:VEVENT
