X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316522407/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Beaver Dam Workday
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T114500
DTSTAMP:20261017T041323Z
UID:event_316522407@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T084500
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261004T001006Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nThe trail system at Beaver 
 Dam is one of the older trails in the Triangle. This trail suffers constan
 t erosion due to the hilly terrain and multiple streams in the area. The t
 rail needs regular maintenance to help maintain drainage so it can reopen 
 quickly after rain events.\n\n**Directions: Meet at the dirt parking lot j
 ust off Creedmoor Rd\, 0.5 mile before Beaver Dam park entrance.**\n\n* Me
 et time: 8:45-11:00\, we will distribute tools and talk about specific wor
 k to be done. We will stop earlier than 11am if it is hot.\n* Duration of 
 the workday: No more than 3 hours\n* Type of Work: Moving dirt and rocks\,
  shaping features\, clearing vines and brush\, de-berming\, knicks and gra
 de reversals\n* Tools: Tools will be provided.\n* What to bring: sturdy sh
 oes or boots\, gloves\, appropriate clothing\, and water\n\nPlease sign th
 e new 2026 TORC waiver if you have not already signed. Only needs to be do
 ne once per calendar year.\n[https://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415
 052](https://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T001007Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316522407/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
