SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™ FALL YOGA EVENT at For Garden's Sake
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**NOTE THAT IF WE GET RAIN\, EVENT WIL
 L STILL TAKE PLACE WITH YOGA IN THE CHAPEL AT FGS.**\n**Another fun Fall Y
 oga In Nature™\, NC event!!!** \\*\\*We will be joining For Garden's Sak
 e (garden center) for another seasonal yoga event and **FALL THEME** **“
 Harvesting\, transitioning and making room for new growth.”** **$25/pers
 on paid in advance\, at sign up\, to secure your spot.** \\*\\*\\*Pay by V
 enmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 if asked for 4 digits) or by PayPal dgenander
 @yogainnature.com Also accepting Zelle.\n\n\\*\\*BACK AGAIN BY POPULAR DEM
 AND...\\*\\*ALL THINGS FALL!!! Come join us for a 60 minute vinyasa flow t
 o yin practice for ALL LEVELS (as well as first timers). We will gather as
  a community in a yoga practice that will focus on flowing with our breath
  as we move our bodies and connect with nature. (No experience necessary\,
  just an open mind:) Theme of this Fall event: *“Harvesting\, transition
 ing and making room for new growth.”* Stay for hot seasonal tea. Receive
  a small seasonal gift!!!\n\nBring a friend! Gift someone special who love
 s yoga and/or plants. NOTE THAT FOR GARDEN SAKE WILL BE DECORATED WITH FAL
 L DECOR\, for inspiration. Wander the grounds of the garden center's indoo
 r and outdoor plants\, shrubs and trees. Also\, take a look at their potti
 ng shed and visit with the goats and ducks on the property.\n\nBring your 
 own yoga mat and/or towel\, water bottle\, and whatever you may need for y
 our practice.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/316077182/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260811T213749Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T213749Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
