BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:No Kings: Party at the Polls: Vote Early Durham Location #1 of 3
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T120000
DTSTAMP:20261017T041231Z
UID:3olvm1nurkqs4jhroifufqledq@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T100000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261010T003852Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the Durham Resistance Coalition\, Engaged Defenders for D
 emocracy\, League of Women Voters Orange and Durham County\, Democracy Out
  Loud!\, Men 4 Choice\, SURJ\, Carolina Federation\, and Siembra NC as we 
 host a No Kings Party at the Polls to help this nation break a record and 
 have the biggest turnout on an early voting day! \n\nWe will meet from 10a
 m-12pm.\n\nThis will not be a typical No Kings event. This will be a Party
  at the Polls where we will have music and food but no speakers. \n\nThe p
 urpose is two-fold: 1. Encourage as many to vote on Oct 17th as possible\,
  and 2. Sign up for ways to plug in and encourage early voting.\n\nIn Durh
 am\, we will have three geographic locations and ask that people spread ou
 t and not all choose our &quot\;normal&quot\; spot:\n\n1. South Regional L
 ibrary\n2. Durham County Board of Elections\n3. Main Library\n\nThis link 
 is for the South Regional Library. We will meet at Lowes Grove Middle Scho
 ol: 4418 S Alston Ave\, Durham\, NC 27713.\n\nWe will send waves of people
  to march to the polls to not overwhelm the polling station. \n\nWe are as
 king for donations for the food please:\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com
 /url?q=https://www.gofundme.com/f/join-us-for-the-no-kings-rally-in-durham
 -county&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0xEgv6dEx
 BCRtX3gRZVA_-" target="_blank">https://www.gofundme.com/f/join-us-for-the-
 no-kings-rally-in-durham-county</a>\n\nSee you at the Party for the Polls\
 , and please spread the word! \n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https
 ://www.google.com/url?q=https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-def
 enders-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvV
 aw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQih9k" target="_blank">https://substack.com/profile/115
 484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events:
  <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefen
 dersfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVa
 w1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedef
 endersfordemocracy/</a>\n\n\n**We decide who represents us. We decide what
  comes next.**\n\nFor more than a year\, millions of people have come toge
 ther to reject the idea that power belongs to kings\, billionaires\, or po
 liticians who believe they are above the people and the law.\n\nNow\, we a
 re taking the next step\, turning people power into voter power. Unlike pr
 evious No Kings actions\, No Kings: Vote Early\,  is not purely a protest.
  Instead\, on October 17th\, it&#39\;s a day of nonpartisan voter particip
 ation: we are bringing **our community** together to make a plan to vote e
 arly and ensuring every eligible voter understands their options for how t
 o vote and has the opportunity to make their voice heard.\n\nBecause no on
 e person gets to decide our leaders before voters do. On October 17th\, jo
 in us in local events across the country as we get out the early vote and 
 say it loud: no thrones\, no crowns\, no kings. \n\n*No Kings: Vote Early 
 events are nonpartisan and are designed to increase participation from all
  eligible voters.* \n\n*A core principle behind all No Kings events is a c
 ommitment to nonviolent action. We expect all participants to seek to de-e
 scalate any potential confrontation with those who disagree with our value
 s and to act lawfully at these events. Weapons of any kind\, including tho
 se legally permitted\, should not be brought to events.*\n\nHow to prepare
 :\n📢: How to Prepare for Your Event:\n✅: Update your voter registrati
 on → <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.vote.org/am-i-reg
 istered-to-vote/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw
 0qTOg8FaytGnP7DDSuHWa-" target="_blank">https://www.vote.org/am-i-register
 ed-to-vote/</a>\n✅: Recruit friends → We start in our own communities 
 and neighborhoods\, where voting happens. Triple your impact by inviting t
 hree people.\n✅: Broaden your impact  → Post photos/videos with #NoKi
 ngsVoteEarly and encourage others to vote\n\n<a href="https://www.google.c
 om/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/event/1033294/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sou
 rce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2fg1cVdm_iaF9PDkTsegQV" target="_bl
 ank">https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/event/1033294/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261010T003852Z
LOCATION:Lowes Grove Middle School\, 4418 S Alston Ave\, Durham\, NC\, 277
 13
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Defend Democracy Saturdays: Downtown Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T113000
DTSTAMP:20261017T041231Z
UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20261017
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T021307Z
LOCATION:218 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
