DESCRIPTION:<p><b>NOTE: This event has been rescheduled due to inclement w
 eather. We will hold the event on Saturday\, November 7th. Same time\, sam
 e place!</b></p><p>Help the Eno River Association celebrate the sights\, s
 mells\, and sounds of fall on the Eno River! Join us for a <b>FREE</b>\, f
 amily-friendly day of hands-on fun at the Confluence Natural Area.</p><p>G
 et your hands and feet wet while searching the creek for aquatic macroinve
 rtebrates\, make a festive fall-inspired craft\, and learn about some of t
 he Eno’s most fascinating “spooky” species. </p><p><b>This event is
  FREE and registration is NOT required.</b> Drop by anytime between noon
  and 4pm. <b>Geared toward families with kids\, but nature lovers of all a
 ges are welcome. </b><br></p><p><em>Restrooms are available on-site. Two 
 accessible parking spaces connect the paved sidewalk to the pavilion. At l
 east one activity will take place in the paved pavilion. </em></p><p>Ques
 tions? Email <a href="mailto:educatio@enoriver.org" target="_blank"><u>ed
 ucation@enoriver.org</u></a> <u></u>for more information about this event
 .</p>
