 event about Birds of Prey. Our guide will be naturalist and nature photogr
 apher Jason Brown. We’ll look for birds of prey at the Haw River\, such 
 as eagles\, osprey\, and hawks. Bring binoculars if you have them\, and yo
 ur camera if you want to take photos. Meet in the Bynum Mill Access parkin
 g lot at 10:00 AM. This event is free and open to the public\, no sign-up 
 required. All ages welcome.
