UID:10000110-1792263600-1792274400@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Moth Night
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC\, in partnership with Backyard Butterflies\, for a night of mothing! We'll gather around glowing sheets and UV lights to see what nighttime wonders flutter by. This event is perfect for all ages and experience levels — whether you're a seasoned moth lover or just curious to learn more. Become a citizen scientist by bringing a camera or smartphone\, sign up for a free iNaturalist account\, and upload your nighttime discoveries. This event is free\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n 
