DESCRIPTION:Join us for Kids Trick or Treat / No Scare hour before the haun
 tings begin! All the rooms will be open for kids aged 12 and under (with a
  chaperone) to walk through and grab some candy. There will be no scare ac
 tors in any rooms\, however some might be walking around getting ready. Al
 l animatronics\, fog machines and strobe lights will be turned off for the
 ir enjoyment. There will also be photo stations in some of the rooms to ca
 pture the event!\n\nTickets for Trick or Treat will be $5.00 and must be p
 urchased in the visitor center office as a part of presale starting 10/1 o
 r the day of the event until 6:00
