BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-hangs-bedroom-division"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261017T041252Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54223855674218
DTSTART:20261017T210000Z
DTEND:20261018T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Unwind and socialize at Park Hangs\, an outdoor concert series 
 at Bailey Park.\n\nNCMA Winston-Salem and Innovation Quarter are finishing
  the 2026 season of Park Hangs with a special close-out weekend featuring 
 back-to-back concerts on October 16th and 17th!\n\nOn Saturday\, October 1
 7th\, enjoy food and drinks from Incendiary Brewing\, Street Feast food tr
 uck\, and Sippity Sips starting at 5:00 pm. Music by Bedroom Division begi
 ns at 6:00 pm and lasts until 8:00 pm.\n\nBedroom Division is the recordin
 g project from Greensboro-based songwriter\, producer and multi-instrument
 alist Dylan Wishon. Fusing mellow\, home grown indie rock with polished po
 p production and nostalgic synths\, his mellow\, woozy and romantic shimme
 r pop soundscapes are inspired by artists such as Mac DeMarco\, Djo\, Blea
 chers\, and The 1975.\n\nPark Hangs\n\nThe iQ is partnering with NCMA Wins
 ton-Salem to bring the Park Hangs concert series to Bailey Park\, sponsore
 d in part by Atwell Ford Real Estate. Food will be available for purchase 
 from vendors in the park\, and guests are welcome to bring their own snack
 s. Drinks from Incendiary Brewing will be available for purchase near Bail
 ey Park’s food truck court. Outside alcohol is prohibited.\n\nTo keep th
 e concert visible for everyone\, please bring a blanket or a low-backed ch
 air to enjoy the music. Bring your music-loving dogs\, but be sure to keep
  them on a leash throughout the event.\n\nIn the case of inclement weather
 \, cancellations will be announced via social media by 4 pm on the day of 
 the event. Limited street parking is available\, with additional paid park
 ing in the Link Parking Deck (530 North Patterson Ave.).
GEO:36.099305;-80.24067
LOCATION:Bailey Park
SUMMARY:Park Hangs: Bedroom Division
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-hangs-bedroom-division
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Concerts (Music)
END:VEVENT
