DESCRIPTION:We do <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.googl
 e.com/document/d/1dGCE6Dxb5P8_4u4t7MUb0kQMJgsmLMbIiooJubm58P0/edit&amp\;sa
 =D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw24SIYb7QbV_uBUC_6l6Bmr" 
 target="_blank">quarterly eagle counts at Jordan Lake</a>\, and we need pe
 ople to help out. Beginners or experts are welcome. The counts last for 1.
 5 hours. If you are interested\, please contact Andrew Sharp  (<a href="m
 ailto:andrew.sharp@ncparks.gov" target="_blank"><u>andrew.sharp@ncparks.go
 v</u></a>).
