DESCRIPTION:Event: North Carolina State Fair\n\nWhen: October 15–25\, 202
 6\n\nWhere: Dorton Arena\n\nThe Revolution Continues...\n\nThis October\, 
 visit the America 250 NC team at the North Carolina State Fair!\n\nStop by
  Dorton Arena each day to explore 250+ years of North Carolina history\, d
 iscover exhibits\, learn how our state is continuing to commemorate Americ
 a’s 250th anniversary\, and pick up some swag. Plus\, chat with the Amer
 ica 250 NC team and share your own North Carolina stories!\n\n \n\nOther N
 C Department of Natural & Cultural Resources teams you will see during the
  fair:\n\nNorth Carolina Research and Publications\n\nState Archives of No
 rth Carolina\n\nNorth Carolina State Parks and Recreation\n\nNorth Carolin
 a Office of State Archaeology\n\nNorth Carolina Historic Sites\n\nNorth Ca
 rolina Museum of History\n\nNorth Carolina Zoo\n\n#LearningHappensHere\n\n
 and volunteers throughout DNCR helping to staff Dorton Arena!
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:America 250 NC at the NC State Fair
