DESCRIPTION:Think first. Prompt second.\n\n \n\nThe UNC Hussman School of J
 ournalism and Media is thrilled to announce the second annual Converge-Con
 \, an exploration of the rapid convergence of human skills with artificial
  intelligence.\n\n \n\nThis year's theme is "Creativity in the Age of AI."
  Through a series of participatory workshops\, experiments and performance
 s\, the audience will question AI's place in creative media and the arts. 
 Decide for yourself where it's useful and where human creativity should le
 ad.\n\n \n\nFree and open to all. Learn more and view the full schedule of
  events at converge-con.ai.
LOCATION:UNC-Chapel Hill
SUMMARY:Converge-Con 2026
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/converge-con-2026
