DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger for a hike to the Holden mill settlement. We will
  discuss the Kirk-Holden war\, political turmoil\, and civil unrest in the
  area.\n\nThis hike is entirely off trail. All children must be accompanie
 d by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\, wea
 r hiking shoes\, and bring water! \n\nSpaces are limited\, and registratio
 n is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks
 .gov. Include the number of guests in your party and a phone number where 
 you can be reached if the event is changed or canceled.
