DESCRIPTION:Join us in the heart of Downtown Yadkinville for two days of fa
 mily fun celebrating the culture\, history\, and people that make the Yadk
 in Valley home. Friday\, October 23rd brings a night of nostalgia with roc
 kabilly and bluegrass music\, featuring The Kody Norris Show\, a chicken s
 tew competition\, a carnival\, and lots of food trucks. The fun continues 
 all day Saturday\, October 24th\, with the second day of carnival fun\, mu
 sic\, and food. Saturday's event will also feature Yadkinville native and 
 Nashville recording artist James Tucker\, a flyover airplane parade\, and 
 a home food preservation competition. Don't miss this first edition festiv
 al!
