 n from 10 a.m. - 2 p.m. and include food trucks\, music\, nature & cultura
 l exhibits\, bounce house\, wagon rides\, scavenger hunt\, kids crafts\, l
 ive animals and much more!\n\nA FREE 5K Fun Run/Walk on the Dismal Swamp C
 anal Trail (NC) starts at 9 a.m. No registration is required\, but a waive
 r must be signed before the race. This family friendly event welcomes stro
 llers and allows participants to walk/run at their own pace. Participants 
 will receive a special Dismal Day giveaway from the Dismal Swamp State Par
 k.\n\nDo not miss this annual family festival celebrating history and natu
 re!
