DESCRIPTION:Join us for this intimate\, open-house style tour of the Old Ke
 ntucky Home as we explore how the Wolfe Family grappled with death\, spiri
 tualism\, and mysteries of the beyond. Discover stories of early 20th cent
 ury funerary practices\, family visions\, and the ways death shaped one of
  America’s greatest writers. \n\nCome and see the skeletons in our close
 ts.\n\nLight refreshments and activities will be provided!\n\n$10 per pers
 on (can be purchased ahead of time or in-person day of)
