X-SOURCE-ID:unitedarts
X-SOURCE:United Arts Wake County
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T183000
DTSTAMP:20250801T220516Z
CREATED:20250801T220516Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250801T220516Z
UID:10002947-1792947600-1792953000@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:Roll\, Release and Reset
DESCRIPTION:Ages 18+\nThis workshop focuses on enhancing strength and stability in the body and pelvic floor region through a combination of exercises and techniques. This class will also provide a self-care component that empowers participants to take control of their health. \nIn addition to targeted exercises\, participants will also learn myofascial release techniques using therapy balls to promote relaxation and release tension in the muscles. Join us to improve your pelvic floor health and overall well-being.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/roll-release-and-reset/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:Arts Together\, 114 SAINT MARYS ST\, RALEIGH\, NC\, 27605-1809\, United States
CATEGORIES:Workshop
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/reynolda-on-the-house"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261017T041253Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54168757247306
DTSTART:20261025T173000Z
DTEND:20261025T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming Date and Time(s):\nOct 25\, 2026\, 1:30pm — 4:30pm\n
 \nNov 15\, 2026\, 1:30pm — 4:30pm\n\n \n\nLocation: Reynolda House Museu
 m of American Art\n\nCost: Free to attend\n\nAll are welcome to visit Reyn
 olda “On the House”!\n\nWe invite you to enjoy the exhibitions Flash P
 oint: The Civil Rights Photography of Danny Lyon and Art & Democracy.\n\nO
 ne of the oldest forms of storytelling in the United States is puppetry\, 
 used for entertainment\, education\, and political statement. To celebrate
  this facet of American creative ingenuity\, Reynolda welcomes Paperhand P
 uppets\, a puppetry arts organization\, performing World of Wonder\, a whi
 msical and interactive showcase of creatures and characters from Paperhand
 ’s 26 year history that celebrates the wild wisdom of our world.\n\nMade
  possible in part by a grant from America 250 NC\, an initiative by the No
 rth Carolina Department of Natural and Cultural Resources.\n\nReservations
  are encouraged by not required. Please note\, no outside food or drinks\,
  backpacks\, or oversized purses are allowed inside the museum.
GEO:36.125831;-80.282305
LOCATION:Reynolda House Museum of American Art
SUMMARY:Reynolda on the House
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/reynolda-on-the-house
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Exhibitions
END:VEVENT
