DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Austin's skeleton crew and cool ghouls for a fun an
 d festive hour at Jockey's Ridge State Park. Learn about what goes bump in
  the park after dark. This spook-tacular program will include a presentati
 on on nocturnal critters\, fun games\, and creepy nature crafts. We will m
 ake Halloween-themed art using natural materials!\n\nTreats and gift bags 
 will be provided by NC State Parks and the Friends of Jockey's Ridge. This
  program is intended for ages 6 to 12.\n\nPre-registration is required in 
 advance.\n\nPlease email austin.paul@ncparks.gov for details.
