UID:b8678c76446aa985bcb753be72cd664b@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:DURHAM\, GET READY TO ROLL! A NEW LOCATION\, BIGGER OPPORTUNIT
 IES\, AND A WHOLE LOT TO CELEBRATE! The Greater Durham Chamber of Commerce
  is excited to join the AMB Tires & Wheels family as we celebrate the gran
 d opening of their SECOND location\, right here in Durham\, NC! AMB Tires 
 & Wheels is a family-owned and operated business dedicated to helping cust
 omers upgrade their rides with quality products and personalized service. 
 Specializing in tires\, custom wheels\, lift kits\, and leveling kits\, AM
 B is all about helping you find the right fit for your vehicle\, whether y
 ou're looking for everyday reliability\, a bold new look\, or an upgrade t
 hat takes your ride to the next level! And now\, they're bringing that sam
 e commitment to quality\, customer service\, and community to the Bull Cit
 y! Join us as we officially cut the ribbon\, welcome AMB Tires & Wheels to
  Durham\, and celebrate this exciting milestone with the family behind the
  business! Here's what you can look forward to: An exciting ribbon 
LOCATION:Durham\, NC
URL:https://members.durhamchamber.org/events/details/amb-tires-wheels-gran
 d-opening-ribbon-cutting-celebration
X-SOURCE:Durham Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
