UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54161503585134
DTSTART:20261026T160000Z
DTEND:20261026T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Stressful situations\, whether from internal or external source
 s\, are inevitable in organizations. For some managers\, this may lead to 
 over-extending themselves with minimal time for self-care. This training o
 ffers tools to help managers cope with stress and thrive in their organiza
 tions.\n\nClick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Req
 uest” button to automatically enroll.
