DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the last week of Campus Sustainability Month with a c
 ampus cleanup!\n\n \n\nYou have two opportunities to participate on Monday
 \, October 26! The first cleanup shift leaves the Pit at 12:15 pm and retu
 rns at 12:45. The second leaves at 1:15 and returns at 1:45 pm.\n\n \n\nDi
 d we mention this cleanup is in friendly competition with the University o
 f Miami? Ahead of our Carolina Sustainability Football Game\, Miami's sust
 ainability office is hosting their own cleanup the same week. At the end o
 f the week\, we'll share photos from both cleanups.\n\n \n\nThis event is 
 in collaboration with Student Government Department of Environmental Affai
 rs and EcoAthletes. We will provide trash bags\, gloves and trash pickers.
  We suggest wearing closed-toe shoes. You are invited to walk or jog (Happ
 y Plogtober!) the route.
LOCATION:The Pit
SUMMARY:Campus Sustainability Week Cleanup
