DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger to explore remnants of the historic trading path 
 known as Fish Dam Road. We will hike about 4 miles in total\, including at
  least a mile of off trail hiking along old roads. One major creek crossin
 g and the ability to navigate some tricky terrain is required.\n\nAt least
  1 mile of hiking is off trail with one major creek crossing and some hill
 y terrain. This hike can be difficult for those unfamiliar with off trail 
 hiking. All children must be accompanied by an adult. Please be sure to dr
 ess appropriately for the weather\, wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n
 \nSpaces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (98
 4) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests i
 n your party and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is c
 hanged or canceled.
LOCATION:Eno River State Park - Cabelands Access\, Parking Lot
SUMMARY:Fish Dam Road Hike
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/fish-dam-road-hike
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
