DESCRIPTION:Join us as we paddle across Hanging Rock Lake beneath the glow 
 of October’s full moon. As the moon rises and illuminates the water\, we
 ’ll take time to reflect on the history and traditions behind the Hunter
 ’s Moon and discover how this seasonal full moon earned its name. Canoes
 \, paddles\, and life jackets will be provided. This program is designed f
 or adults and is limited to registered participants. To register for this 
 event\, please email\n\nandra-claire.greene@ncparks.gov.
