 ure to dress appropriately for the weather\, wear hiking shoes\, and bring
  water!\n\nSpaces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\,
  call (984) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of
  guests in your party and a phone number where you can be reached if the e
