DESCRIPTION:Bird Cruise: Set sail on a guided birding adventure through the
  waters surrounding Hammocks Beach State Park. This ranger-led excursion w
 ill help you identify wading birds\, shorebirds\, raptors\, and seasonal m
 igrants while exploring some of the area's premier birding locations. Brin
 g your binoculars and curiosity as we search for feathered residents and v
 isitors that depend on our estuarine habitats. Limited to 11 participants\
 ; sign-up is required. To register\, you must come to the Visitor Center t
 o sign-up.
