DESCRIPTION:Adults worldwide are sleep deprived. One way to get better slee
 p is to improve the process of getting to sleep\, by using a pleasant and 
 effective bedtime routine. This workshop provides a closer look at simple 
 routines that can end the day in a calming\, mindful way\; going-to-bed te
 chniques that promote quality sleep\, including opportunities to practice.
 \n\nClick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request
 ” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Bedtime Routines for Adults
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/bedtime-routines-for-adults-15
 93
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
