 d Student Resource Corner\n\n \n\nCarolina Innovators Connect offers stude
 nts and startups an event that gives students learning and career developm
 ent opportunities with high-growth startup companies\, social ventures and
  innovative opportunities in the Research Triangle region. Think career fa
 ir ...but not! No suits or resumes here.\n\n \n\nStudents should come prep
 ared to mingle with a diverse group of businesses and founders in a casual
  environment. Local companies and nonprofits that are eager to work with t
 alented students through internship and employment are given a free opport
 unity to post their jobs and mingle with candidates.\n\n \n\nWe will also 
 offer a Resource Center for students and companies to learn more about inn
 ovation resources on UNC's campus and in the Triangle region. Check back s
 oon for a full list of participating companies.\n\n \n\nFind more details 
 here
