CREATED:20260811T175133Z
DESCRIPTION:Team On Draft - Road Cycling\n**We will host a beach house wee
 kend again with the 6th Annual Haunted Hundred as the main event!** This k
 eeps getting better every year! It's much more than riding and there’s p
 lenty for our non-riding friends to enjoy.\n\n*You do not need to particip
 ate in the beach house or the weekend events in order to ride with us on S
 unday's Haunted Hundred Ride. The Haunted Hundred Ride will be posted sepa
 rately.*\n\n**Friday Evening** we may hit a bar or two for some dancing an
 d playing pool. Let's break the ice and get acquainted with your housemate
 s.\n\n**Saturday** after Michael prepares his famous breakfast of pumpkin 
 pancakes and maple link sausage. Some folks may opt for some kayaking arou
 nd Permuda Island if the rental establishments are open. Many enjoy some b
 each time. Do your own thing or do something with others\; your choice.\n\
 n**Saturday Evening** you can choose to go out to your favorite restaurant
  or partake in the group feast (traditionally from Topsail Steamer!) at th
 e beach house.\n\n**On Sunday**\, the Drafters ride with the Turtles!! Eve
 ryone can regroup at the Post Ride Party at Salty's Surf Shack (be sure to
  purchase the tickets for Non-Riding Guests). Stay Sunday night and rest o
 r\, if you need to head back home\, you’ll have the beach house to fresh
 en up for the ride back home. Our check-out will not be until Monday morni
 ng.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n1\\. Please sign up for the ride on your own\\
 . Details are at Salty Turtle Cycling Club Haunted Hundred\\. There are on
 ly 63 spots left\\.\n\n2\\. Contact Margaret\\-Anne to provide your paymen
 t $530\\.00 for a bedroom with private bathroom in this year's beach house
 \\. We think this is a great deal for your own king or queen bed with priv
 ate bathroom\\. It's 1\\.4 miles from the Surf Shack\\. If it doesn't fill
  by July 30th\, we will cancel\, but this event has just gets bigger and b
 igger every year so please reply quickly if you want in on the house\\. Yo
 u can find it by looking on VRBO\\. The name of the property on VRBO is "O
 ceanfront Retreat with Premium Views\, Roof Top Hot Tub\, Private Pool\, G
 ame Room and More\\.\\.\\.\\!"\n\nIf our house is at capacity\, please con
 sider starting your rental. We can share our address and include everyone 
 in the group fun. Just let us know.\n\nMichael & Margaret-Anne\n\n\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nPlease see the official page fo
 r the [5th Annual Haunted Hundred Bike Ride Event October 26\, 2025-Salty 
 Turtle Cycling Club](https://saltyturtlecycling.raklet.com/Events/Home/Det
 ails/df44c52c-4cb4-439a-ab57-145be2d604c8) at raklet.com!\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T000945Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
