DESCRIPTION:Warning: The stars aren't the only things lurking in the dark t
 his October...👀\n\n \n\nIn Scare-olina Skies\, Morehead Planetarium and
  Science Center is taking you on a tour of the Chapel Hill night sky while
  sharing tales and legends of monsters\, mayhem\, and madness. With 360° 
 views and a temperature-controlled environment\, this special show offers 
 an immersive way to start your Halloweekend.\n\n\nℹ️ Scare-olina Skies
  is not recommended for children.
