DESCRIPTION:Join Sustainable Carolina for the fourth annual sustainability 
 football game\, spooky edition\, on Halloween!\n\n \n\nOn the last day of 
 Campus Sustainability Month\, the Tar Heels take on the University of Miam
 i. Join us in Kenan Stadium for special in-game messaging from Rameses. Ch
 ancellor Lee Roberts\, Chief Sustainability Officer Mike Piehler\, and Iot
 aComm CEO Terrence DeFranco will talk data\, AI and sustainability during 
 the halftime radio show.\n\n \n\nGame time TBA.\n\n \n\nStart the celebrat
 ions early! Students\, staff and faculty are invited to join us for a camp
 us cleanup\, in friendly competition with the University of Miami\, on Mon
 day\, October 26. There will be two shifts\, the first from 12:15 - 12:45 
 pm and the second from 1:15 - 1:45 pm. We'll have everything you need\, bu
 t bring your closed-toed shoes!
GEO:35.907754;-79.047423
