DESCRIPTION:Link to join: https://www.mobilize.us/join/48337782/1:565bdbd8
 4151a381fd58a833e6c38d1c95a61ba2d5b231083889e828ec23a495/\n\nHow to join:\
 nYou will need at least a basic Zoom account to register.\n\nJoin us on Zo
 om at 6pm ET/5pm CT every week as we gather to drive change through digita
 l organizing. Our texting campaigns will give you the opportunity to engag
 e residents across the U.S. while empowering them to make a positive impac
 t in their communities. Last year\, we sent over 19 million texts educatin
 g residents on local elections\, environmental justice\, police reform\, h
 ealth care\, and so much more! During the event we will provide training\,
  discuss our latest texting campaign\, and we will take action.\n\nA basic
  Zoom account is required to register.\n\nHow to prepare:\nComplete your r
 egistration here via Zoom: https://bit.ly/BVMTextingTuesday.   \n\nYou wil
 l need a basic Zoom account to register. A basic Zoom account is free. \n\
 nFill out the volunteer agreement here - https://forms.office.com/Pages/Re
 sponsePage.aspx?id=4XYntqm7yEqm7h6bNND82BTiriDtw_dLvWG_BUODEPBUMkgyQ1ZQTEN
 CVVBWNTVNQ0pDWVZaNFFLRC4u\n\nhttps://www.mobilize.us/blackvotersmatter/eve
 nt/889579/
