DESCRIPTION:Step into the future of work. No coding required. This hands-on
  session shows you how AI can transform the way you work\, study\, and cre
 ate value every day\, whether you're in marketing\, finance\, education\, 
 healthcare\, or just curious. This workshop helps you become the person wh
 o uses AI\, not the one replaced by it. That person is Fluid-Shaped™: cu
 rious\, quick to try\, and ready to summon whatever skill the moment calls
  for\, with AI's help.\n\nThis event is sponsored by Innovate Carolina\n\n
  \n\nCheck out an exciting video teaser HERE!
