DESCRIPTION:This workshop will explore the environmental impacts of artific
 ial intelligence (AI). We will begin with an overview of AI's environmenta
 l footprint\, covering energy consumption\, water use\, electronic waste\,
  and its impact on communities. Then\, we will discuss practical strategie
 s for reducing and mitigating these impacts.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offe
 red by the University Library and will be led by librarian Katherine Howel
 l.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offered remotely via Zoom only. You can 
 register through the library calendar. Registrants will receive a Zoom lin
 k\; those on the waitlist will not receive a Zoom link unless they are bum
 ped up to a registered spot.\n\n \n\nAll registrants however\, will receiv
 e access to the meeting recording and resources.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Environmental Impacts of Artificial Intelligence
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/environmental-impacts-of-artif
 icial-intelligence
