 ilm returns for another powerful celebration of cinema\, storytelling\, an
 d voices from across the African diaspora. Since 2004\, the festival has b
 rought audiences together for compelling films\, engaging conversations\, 
 and thought-provoking dialogue with filmmakers\, scholars\, and our commun
 ity.\n\n \n\n🎬 Join us for Screening Five of the Stone Center’s Diasp
 ora Festival of Black & Independent Film! \n\n📅 Thursday\, Nov. 5\n⏰ 
 6:30 p.m.\n📍 Sonja Haynes Stone Center\n🎥 A must-see film\n✨ Free 
 & open to all\n\nExperience another evening of powerful cinema\, storytell
 ing\, and conversation celebrating voices from across the African diaspora
 .\n\n👉 RSVP: https://go.unc.edu/filmfest2026
