DESCRIPTION:Jockey’s Ridge State Park will be hosting an evening under th
 e stars on Friday\, November 6\, 2026 from 5:30 to 8:30 p.m. Telescopes wi
 ll be set up for public viewing. Kids' activities will also be taking plac
 e within the Community Room. Our knowledgeable partners will guide you acr
 oss the universe.\n\nBe a SHINING STAR and support the event by dropping o
 ff a food item or hygeine product for local individuals in need over the h
 oliday season. Friends of Jockey's Ridge members will be collecting donati
 ons throughout the evening. Donations will be delivered to Beach Food Pant
 ry.\n\nThis event is made possible with the support of Beach Food Pantry\,
  Friends of Jockey’s Ridge\, OBX Astronomy Club\, Dare County Library\, 
 and additional park volunteers\n\nPlease remember that there are restricti
 ons on the types of food donations the Beach Food Pantry can accept. Also\
 , please note that all donations we accept must include an ingredient list
  and the nutrition facts.\n\nThe Beach Food Pantry can take close-dated or
  expired foods under certain conditions.\n\nSuggested donation items are b
 elow:\n\nCanned Vegetables (~15 oz)Canned Fruit (~15 oz)Peanut Butter (18 
 oz)Canned Chicken\, Ham or Tuna (5 oz cans)Brown Rice (16 oz)Canned SoupPo
 rk & BeansCanned Beef StewCanned Beef Chili with BeansDiced Canned Tomatoe
 s (14.5 oz)Grape or Strawberry Jelly (18 oz)Pancake Mix (“Complete” 
 – or “just add water”)Pancake SyrupHamburger HelperSalad DressingToo
 thpasteFeminine Products
GEO:35.963597;-75.632255
LOCATION:Jockey's Ridge State Park - Main Access and Visitor Center\, Parki
 ng area and Community Room 
