 s for reducing and mitigating these impacts.\n\nThis workshop is offered b
 y the University Library and will be led by librarian Katherine Howell.\n\
 n \n\nThis workshop is being offered remotely via Zoom only. Register thro
 ugh the library calendar. Registrants will receive a Zoom link\; those on 
 the waitlist will not receive a Zoom link unless they are bumped up to a r
 egistered spot.\n\n \n\nAll registrants however\, will receive access to t
 he meeting recording and resources.
