 e Loading Dock in Wake Forest. What to Expect: Complimentary coffee and li
 ght breakfast snacks Opportunity to network with professionals from divers
 e industries Casual\, friendly atmosphere to make new contacts & swap busi
 ness cards A fun raffle opportunity! This is the perfect chance to start y
 our day meeting new people\, sharing ideas\, and growing your professional
