DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the opening of The Doctor Is In\, a new permanent exh
 ibit at the Pope House Museum! Explore the experiences\, challenges\, and 
 achievements of Black physicians in the 20th-century South through origina
 l artifacts from the renowned Pope Collection. Discover an important chapt
 er of medical history and the contributions of Black medical professionals
 .\n\nJoin us Saturday\, November 14\, from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. Admission is 
 free\, all ages are welcome\, and no registration is required.\n\n \n\nLoc
 ation: Pope House Museum\nDate: Saturday\, Nov. 14\nTime: 10 a.m. - 4 p.m.
 \nAges: All\nCosts: Free\nNo Registration Required
GEO:35.77372;-78.638254
LOCATION:Pope House Museum
SUMMARY:Exhibit Opening: The Doctor Is In
