UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54168774741097
DTSTART:20261115T183000Z
DTEND:20261115T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming Date and Time(s):\nOct 25\, 2026\, 1:30pm — 4:30pm\n
 \nNov 15\, 2026\, 1:30pm — 4:30pm\n\nLocation: Reynolda House Museum of 
 American Art\n\nCost: Free to attend\n\nAll are welcome to visit Reynolda 
 “On the House”!\n\nWe invite you to enjoy the exhibitions Flash Point:
  The Civil Rights Photography of Danny Lyon and Art & Democracy.\n\nOne of
  the oldest forms of storytelling in the United States is puppetry\, used 
 for entertainment\, education\, and political statement. To celebrate this
  facet of American creative ingenuity\, Reynolda welcomes Paperhand Puppet
 s\, a puppetry arts organization\, performing World of Wonder\, a whimsica
 l and interactive showcase of creatures and characters from Paperhand’s 
 26 year history that celebrates the wild wisdom of our world.\n\nMade poss
 ible in part by a grant from America 250 NC\, an initiative by the North C
 arolina Department of Natural and Cultural Resources.\n\nReservations are 
 encouraged by not required. Please note\, no outside food or drinks\, back
 packs\, or oversized purses are allowed inside the museum.
GEO:36.125831;-80.282305
LOCATION:Reynolda House Museum of American Art
SUMMARY:Reynolda on the House
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/reynolda-on-the-house-9785
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Exhibitions
END:VEVENT
