 g about the important races in NC\, including Roy Cooper for US Senate and
  Anita Earls for NC Supreme Court.\n\nWe will meet at Common Market at 182
 1 Green St.\n\nThanks Diane and Barbara for being the Voter Registration l
 eads for Durham!\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobi
 lize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/952910/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=ca
