DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and experience a colonial Christmas through s
 easonal hands-on activities and games. Discover the colonial and revolutio
 nary history of northeastern North Carolina as you watch the Albemarle Exp
 ress model train. The museum will be decorated with Christmas trees from e
 ach of the thirteen counties represented at the museum. Explore a petting 
 zoo full of farm animals from 10:30 a.m. to 1:30 p.m. Santa Claus will mak
 e his grand entrance to check your Christmas lists from 1:30 to 2:30 p.m.
GEO:36.296532;-76.219757
LOCATION:Museum of the Albemarle
