DESCRIPTION:Join us for extended hours at the Ackland Art Museum during the
  Carrboro-Chapel Hill 2nd Friday ArtWalk! Each month\, we stay open from 5
 :00 – 9:00 p.m. to give visitors more time to explore. \nStroll through 
 our galleries featuring highlights from a collection of over 21\,000 works
  of art and sketch in the galleries using art supplies from our lobby’s 
 art cart. \nAdmission to the Ackland is always free\; no prior registratio
 n needed. Whether you’re stopping by solo or bringing friends\, come be 
 inspired during our extended open hours!
