DESCRIPTION:Step into History This Holiday Season\n\nJoin us for the “Hom
 e for the Holidays: A Victorian Holiday Open House of the Old Kentucky Hom
 e.” Experience the warmth and charm of Holiday traditions in Thomas Wolf
 e’s world. Come see the home all dressed up in its Christmas finest! Gue
 sts will walk through the boardinghouse at their leisure to view this pop-
 up Holiday Traditions exhibit. \n\nEnjoy holiday crafts\, our exhibit hall
 \, Christmas cookies\, and warm apple cider in the Memorial’s Visitor Ce
 nter. Last admission to the house is at 6:45 pm.
