DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Wednesday fr
 om 5-7pm and Saturday from 3-5 as we register voters in Durham. We will tr
 ain you and provide forms. We will be registering voters as well as talkin
 g about the important races in NC\, including Roy Cooper for US Senate and
  Anita Earls for NC Supreme Court.\n\nWe will meet at Common Market at 182
 1 Green St.\n\nThanks Diane and Barbara for being the Voter Registration l
 eads for Durham!\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobi
 lize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/952910/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=ca
 lendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1jH0kGYD9b-KkBsZHpBxW6" target="_blank">h
 ttps://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/952910/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T021017Z
LOCATION:Common Market\, 1821 Green St\, Durham\, NC\, 27705
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
