UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54239534732565
DTSTART:20270128T190000Z
DTEND:20270128T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Temple Theatre is one of North Carolina's premier regional thea
 tres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sanf
 ord. \n\nAfter his family was torn apart and parceled out to various benef
 iciaries of the Louisa County\, Virginia estate\, Henry “Box” Brown\, 
 born into slavery\, devised an ingenious escape plan – sealing himself i
 n a wooden box for shipment to friends and freedom. One Noble Journey also
  recounts the daring and miraculous quest for freedom of Elizabeth Craft a
 nd her husband William.\n\nTickets range from $25 to $40 with discounts av
 ailable for active military\, Lee County educators and students\, and grou
 ps of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or call 919-774-4512 for more info
 rmation.
GEO:35.48114;-79.178793
LOCATION:Temple Theatre
SUMMARY:Temple Theatre Presents: "One Noble Journey"
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/temple-theatre-presents-one-
 noble-journey
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Theater & Musicals
END:VEVENT
