 n a wooden box for shipment to friends and freedom. One Noble Journey also
  recounts the daring and miraculous quest for freedom of Elizabeth Craft a
 nd her husband William.\n\nTickets range from $25 to $40 with discounts av
 ailable for active military\, Lee County educators and students\, and grou
 ps of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or call 919-774-4512 for more info
 rmation.
GEO:35.48114;-79.178793
LOCATION:Temple Theatre
SUMMARY:Temple Theatre Presents: "One Noble Journey"
