DESCRIPTION:Temple Theatre is one of North Carolina's premier regional thea
 tres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sanf
 ord. \n\nJourney back in time for a musical exploration through a war that
  redefined the world. This multimedia living history cabaret is interspers
 ed with personal letters from the war front and headline news of the perio
 d.\n\nTickets range from $25 to $40 with discounts available for active mi
 litary\, Lee County educators and students\, and groups of 10 or more. Vis
 it templeshows.org or call 919-774-4512 for more information.
