UID:event_wqlzlsykchbgb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041242Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270504T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270504T190000
SUMMARY:Downtown Techies Durham and Raleigh MERGE FOR THE SUMMER! 
DESCRIPTION:Downtown Techies: Durham\nHey Techies!\n\nWe are so excited to
  see you all again! Heads up! for the summer months we are merging all of 
 our events into an event once a month on the first Tuesday of every month!
 \n\nDon't forget to RSVP for first round free!!\n\nWe will be resuming Dow
 ntown Durham events in September on the third Tuesday of every month. We w
 ould love your suggestions on venues! Just ping us.\n\nQuestions or sugges
 tions?\n\nOur digital door is always open at www.downtowntechies.com or @d
 owntowntechies. Check out our events in Raleigh as well!\n\nMeet\, Drink a
 nd be TECHIE!\n\n-Jake and Blake\n\nLooking to get more connected to the l
 ocal tech scene\, opportunity or talent? Email us info@downtowntechies.com
  and we will make sure you find what you need!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/downtown-techies-durham/events/wqlzls
 ykchbgb/
